# ThermaSol APK: nav-bar visibility + footer layout
# Applied as a smali edit to the INSTALLED apk (see docs/06-procedures.md section G).
# Paths are relative to the smali root of classes2.dex.
#
# Utils.applyFullscreenOptions: 0x1006 -> 0x4   (stop hiding the nav bar)
# MainControl.selectTopMenuFromDeviceConfig: constrain fragment height between the
#   vendor's top and bottom bars instead of computing it from display metrics.
#
